// `_kpool_assemble_softmax_rotate_write_cache_kernel` with a native kernel
// that uses the SAME `gemm_bf16` bf16-storage convention PR #52 established
// (bf16 storage + fp32 accumulation, NO `fp8e4nv` in any signature). The
// decode counterpart follows the identical bf16 pattern; both are reached
